{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When reality becomes too much to bear, the only escape is the utopia you built with millions of lines of code. In this world, you are not a hero bound by rules. You are the Creator. The laws of physics, logic, and morality? They are yours to rewrite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this retro top-down pixel adventure, use your &quot;Developer Tools&quot; to hack the system, and uncover the glitchy, cruel truth behind &quot;Destiny.&quot; </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hack, Paint, &amp; Compose</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget swords and shields. As the architect of this world, your professional skills are your deadliest arsenal:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Code:</strong> Reprogram enemy logic, trigger fatal traps, or simply delete the bugs that stand in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art:</strong> Hit a dead end? Redraw the map! Create bridges from thin air or warp the terrain to trap your foes on an isolated island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong> Manipulate the BGM to control the flow of battle. Drive enemies into a chaotic panic or boost your own focus with an adrenaline-pumping rhythm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/de29bb033660452f9bef5fcab7e28fcb.poster.avif?t=1767066135\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/de29bb033660452f9bef5fcab7e28fcb.webm?t=1767066135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/de29bb033660452f9bef5fcab7e28fcb.mp4?t=1767066135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These tools aren't just for killing\u2014they are the keys to the world. Break the conventional puzzle logic and reconstruct the levels. The solution is limited only by your imagination. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >God or Devil?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world governed by your will, there is no law but yours. The <strong>&quot;Karma System&quot;</strong> watches your every move. Every line of code you change leads to a different ending:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Benevolent God:</strong> Help NPCs, fix their problems, and find a peaceful path through the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Living Nightmare:</strong> Don't like an NPC's attitude? Wipe them out. Leave a trail of digital blood wherever you go.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: <strong>Every &quot;gift&quot; you grant comes with a price tag written in the source code.</strong> Some costs will elevate you to divinity, while others may corrupt your soul beyond repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/2080395fea9e60c47d692d5e2817cb7f.poster.avif?t=1767066135\" width=802 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/2080395fea9e60c47d692d5e2817cb7f.webm?t=1767066135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/2080395fea9e60c47d692d5e2817cb7f.mp4?t=1767066135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reality vs. Fiction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a game; it is an interrogation of <strong>Dreams vs. Reality</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the virtual characters show emotions more real than the humans outside, can you still bring yourself to press &quot;Delete&quot;?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your bank account hits zero and your family begs you to quit, will you seek salvation inside your own creation?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice triggers a butterfly effect. Rewrite the story\u2014for them, or for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/3d424f5da9570f88de6f83e728b3adc9.poster.avif?t=1767066135\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/3d424f5da9570f88de6f83e728b3adc9.webm?t=1767066135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/3d424f5da9570f88de6f83e728b3adc9.mp4?t=1767066135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u82cf\u9192","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611410/aca9a3861a65cf921e9881f7b5e1b0d7ce3a2400.jpg"},{"name":"\u5192\u9669\u5f00\u59cb\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611410/43e98fee1950ac601c0fc843d51da4b97c8fe720.jpg"},{"name":"\u90aa\u6076\u8001\u767b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611410/73c6df84ef88a5e59809acd59e2c7026c6f0cac2.jpg"},{"name":"\u51cb\u96f6\u4e4b\u5730","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611410/e34187f5d038ed51337979f669ba25611f91faf4.jpg"},{"name":"\u5c0a\u8001\u7231\u5e7c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611410/617475d07fd7ceb3d04c00ececec15775c9c8f99.jpg"},{"name":