aecb7a5fb092889527b91d84c1.600x338.jpg?t=1767066135"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/a9bdacd3136fa0217040fce38c0b54eaed6616d3/ss_a9bdacd3136fa0217040fce38c0b54eaed6616d3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767066135","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/a9bdacd3136fa0217040fce38c0b54eaed6616d3/ss_a9bdacd3136fa0217040fce38c0b54eaed6616d3.600x338.jpg?t=1767066135"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/262e738bac2751ce6afe11d88e835c1bae03b629/ss_262e738bac2751ce6afe11d88e835c1bae03b629.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767066135","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/262e738bac2751ce6afe11d88e835c1bae03b629/ss_262e738bac2751ce6afe11d88e835c1bae03b629.600x338.jpg?t=1767066135"}],"short_description":"Don't just play the game\u2014rewrite it. Dive into your own creation as a burnt-out developer. Use Code to hack enemies, Art to reshape the map, and Music to control minds. Will you be a benevolent god or a glitchy tyrant in this meta-pixel adventure?","steam_appid":2611410,"support_info":{"email":"support@2pgames.net","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English, Japanese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":null}